# UI

Shared controls live in `component-library/`. Merge classes with `cn` from `lib/utils.ts`. Icons come from `lucide-react`.

Forms use `react-hook-form` with a Zod schema and `import { z } from 'zod'`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className={`${itemClass} ${selected ? selectedClass : ''}`}
import { FaCheckCircle } from 'react-icons/fa';

// ✅ GOOD
className={cn(itemClass, selected && selectedClass)}
import { CheckCircle } from 'lucide-react';

const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof VerseSetSchema>>({
  defaultValues: { name: '' },
});
```
